OL,3,GNEWSACouncil owed more than #158m in
OL,4,Aunpaid invoices
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Sussex County Council (WSCC) is
OL,7,Fowed more than #158m in unpaid
OL,8,Finvoices, councillors have been told.
OL,10,FWith a large portion of it related to
OL,11,Fadult social care, the figure was
OL,12,Fshared during a scrutiny committee
OL,13,Fmeeting on Friday.
OL,15,FJane Davey, cabinet member for finance
OL,16,Fand property, said it was having "a
OL,17,Fhuge impact" on the council's cash flow
OL,18,Fand blamed "slow payments" from
OL,19,Forganisations like NHS Surrey and
OL,20,FSussex Integrated Care Board (SSICB) as
OL,21,Fpart of the problem.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
